OverTheWire Bandit: Level 10 → 11

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 11.
The password is stored in the file data.txt, which is Base64 encoded.

Steps
Log in as bandit10:
ssh bandit10@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Decode the Base64 content:
base64 -d data.txt

Result
The decoded output displays the password for Bandit Level 11.

